msgstr "Lisainfo jaoks vaata palun <a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/us/webapps/mpp/ua/privacy-full\">PayPal Privacy Policy</a> lehte."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:128
msgid "We accept payments through PayPal. When processing payments, some of your data will be passed to PayPal, including information required to process or support the payment, such as the purchase total and billing information."
msgstr "Võtame makseid vastu PayPali kaudu. Maksete töötlemisel edastatakse osa sinu andmetest PayPalile, sealhulgas makse töötlemiseks või toetamiseks vajalik teave, näiteks ostu kogusumma ja arveldusandmed."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:126
msgid "In this subsection you should list which third party payment processors you’re using to take payments on your store since these may handle customer data. We’ve included PayPal as an example, but you should remove this if you’re not using PayPal."
msgstr "Selles alajaos peaksid loetlema, milliseid kolmandate osapoolte maksetöötlejaid kasutad oma poes maksete vastuvõtmiseks, kuna need võivad töödelda kliendiandmeid. Oleme lisanud PayPali näitena, kuid peaksid selle eemaldama, kui sa PayPali ei kasuta."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:123
msgid "We share information with third parties who help us provide our orders and store services to you; for example --"
msgstr "Me jagame infot kolmandate osapooltega, kes aitavad meil teie jaoks tellimusi ja poega seonduvaid teenuseid pakkuda; näiteks --"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:121
msgid "In this section you should list who you’re sharing data with, and for what purpose. This could include, but may not be limited to, analytics, marketing, payment gateways, shipping providers, and third party embeds."
msgstr "Selles jaos peaksid loetlema, kellega sa andmeid jagad ja mis eesmärgil. See võib hõlmata muu hulgas analüütikat, turundust, makselüüse, saatmise teenusepakkujaid ja kolmandate osapoolte manuseid."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:119
msgid "What we share with others"
msgstr "Mida me teistega jagame"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:118
msgid "Our team members have access to this information to help fulfill orders, process refunds and support you."
msgstr "Meie meeskonna liikmetel on juurdepääs sellele teabele, et aidata täita tellimusi, töödelda tagasimakseid ja sind toetada."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:116
msgid "Customer information like your name, email address, and billing and shipping information."
msgstr "Kliendiinfo, nagu sinu nimi, e-posti aadress ning arveldus- ja saatmisinfo."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:115
msgid "Order information like what was purchased, when it was purchased and where it should be sent, and"
msgstr "Tellimuse teave, näiteks mida osteti, millal see osteti ja kuhu see tuleks saata, ning"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:113
msgid "Members of our team have access to the information you provide us. For example, both Administrators and Shop Managers can access:"
msgstr "Meie tiimi liikmetel on juurdepääs teabele, mille meile esitad. Näiteks pääsevad nii administraatorid kui ka poehaldurid juurde järgmisele:"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:112
msgid "Who on our team has access"
msgstr "Kellel meie meeskonnas on ligipääs"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:111
msgid "We will also store comments or reviews, if you choose to leave them."
msgstr "Salvestame ka kommentaare ning arvustusi, kui sa neid meile jätad."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:110
msgid "We generally store information about you for as long as we need the information for the purposes for which we collect and use it, and we are not legally required to continue to keep it. For example, we will store order information for XXX years for tax and accounting purposes. This includes your name, email address and billing and shipping addresses."
msgstr "Üldiselt säilitame sinu kohta käivat teavet nii kaua, kui vajame seda eesmärkidel, milleks seda kogume ja kasutame, ning kui meil ei ole seaduslikku kohustust seda jätkuvalt säilitada. Näiteks säilitame tellimuse teavet XXX aastat maksustamise ja raamatupidamise eesmärgil. See hõlmab sinu nime, e-posti aadressi ning arvelduse ja saatmise aadresse."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:109
msgid "If you create an account, we will store your name, address, email and phone number, which will be used to populate the checkout for future orders."
msgstr "Kui lood konto, salvestame sinu nime, aadressi, e-posti aadressi ja telefoninumbri. Kasutame neid tulevikus tellimuse vormistamisel andmeväljade automaatseks täitmiseks."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:107
msgid "Send you marketing messages, if you choose to receive them"
msgstr "Saadame sulle turundusliku sisuga teateid, kui sa oled nõus neid saama"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:106
msgid "Improve our store offerings"
msgstr "Parandab meie poe tootevalikut"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:105
msgid "Comply with any legal obligations we have, such as calculating taxes"
msgstr "Järgime kõiki meil lasuvaid juriidilisi kohustusi, näiteks maksude arvutamist"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:104
msgid "Set up your account for our store"
msgstr "Loo konto meie poes"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:103
msgid "Process payments and prevent fraud"
msgstr "Töötle makseid ja ennetage pettusi"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:102
msgid "Respond to your requests, including refunds and complaints"
msgstr "Vastamine sinu taotlustele, sealhulgas tagasimaksetele ja kaebustele"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:101
msgid "Send you information about your account and order"
msgstr "Saadab sulle teavet sinu konto ja tellimuse kohta"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:99
msgid "When you purchase from us, we’ll ask you to provide information including your name, billing address, shipping address, email address, phone number, credit card/payment details and optional account information like username and password. We’ll use this information for purposes, such as, to:"
msgstr "Kui ostad meilt, palume sul esitada teavet, sealhulgas oma nime, arveldusaadressi, saatmisaadressi, e-posti aadressi, telefoninumbrit, krediitkaardi/makse üksikasju ja valikulist konto teavet, nagu kasutajanimi ja parool. Kasutame seda teavet näiteks järgmistel eesmärkidel:"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:97
msgid "Note: you may want to further detail your cookie policy, and link to that section from here."
msgstr "Märkus: võid soovida oma küpsiste poliitikat täiendavalt üksikasjalikumaks teha ja siit sellele jaole linkida."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:95
msgid "We’ll also use cookies to keep track of cart contents while you’re browsing our site."
msgstr "Kasutame küpsiseid ka ostukorvi sisu jälgimiseks, kui sirvid meie saiti."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:93
msgid "Shipping address: we’ll ask you to enter this so we can, for instance, estimate shipping before you place an order, and send you the order!"
msgstr "Tarneaadress: palume sul selle sisestada, et saaksime näiteks hinnata saatmiskulu enne tellimuse esitamist ja sulle tellimuse saata!"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:92
msgid "Location, IP address and browser type: we’ll use this for purposes like estimating taxes and shipping"
msgstr "Asukoht, IP-aadress ja brauseri tüüp: kasutame seda näiteks maksude ja saatmise arvutamiseks"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:91
msgid "Products you’ve viewed: we’ll use this to, for example, show you products you’ve recently viewed"
msgstr "Tooted, mida oled vaadanud: kasutame seda näiteks selleks, et näidata sulle tooteid, mida oled hiljuti vaadanud"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:89
msgid "While you visit our site, we’ll track:"
msgstr "Kui külastate meie lehte, jälgime järgnevat:"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:88
msgid "What we collect and store"
msgstr "Mida me kogume ja salvestame"

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:87
msgid "We collect information about you during the checkout process on our store."
msgstr "Kogume sinu kohta teavet meie poes kassaprotsessi ajal."

#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:85
msgid "This sample language includes the basics around what personal data your store may be collecting, storing and sharing, as well as who may have access to that data. Depending on what settings are enabled and which additional plugins are used, the specific information shared by your store will vary. We recommend consulting with a lawyer when deciding what information to disclose on your privacy policy."
msgstr "See näidiskeel sisaldab põhitõdesid selle kohta, milliseid isikuandmeid sinu pood võib koguda, salvestada ja jagada, samuti seda, kellel võib olla juurdepääs nendele andmetele. Sõltuvalt sellest, millised sätted on lubatud ja milliseid lisapluginaid kasutatakse, võib sinu poe jagatav konkreetne teave erineda. Soovitame konsulteerida juristiga, kui otsustad, millist teavet oma privaatsuspoliitikas avaldada."

